// Cart amounts in yen. `discount` is the customer's discount rate (0.1 = 10%).
// Carts with 10 or more lines get an extra 5% bulk discount, applied once,
// after the customer's discount.

// The amount before rounding to whole yen. Callers pick their own rounding rule:
